>**You must have progressed to at least Mission 12 - {M:Royal Puppeteer|Royal Puppeteer|Royal Puppeteer}' in the {M:Aht Urhgan storyline|Aht Urhgan Missions|Aht Urhgan storyline} to proceed past this mission. To advance, see below.**
=2 Walkthrough
=3 If you have completed the {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Category:Aht Urhgan Missions}
* **OPTIONAL: **Return to your home nation for a cutscene. You will be told to go to the Imperial Whitegate and skip to the mission {M:Aphmau's Light|Aphmau's Light|Aphmau's Light}.
* Examine the {p:Imperial Whitegate} for a cutscene.
* You will skip to the mission {M:Reunited|Reunited|Reunited}, receiving {i:Cipher Of Nashmeira's Alter Ego II|Cipher Of Nashmeira's Alter Ego II|10170} and the ability to view all {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan} mission cutscenes.

=3 If you have not yet completed all of the {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Category:Aht Urhgan Missions}, but you have started Mission 12 - {M:Royal Puppeteer|Royal Puppeteer|Royal Puppeteer}
* Return to your home nation for a cutscene. You will be told to go to the {p:Imperial Whitegate} and also be informed where Aphmau currently is in your mission progress.
* After viewing the cutscene in your home nation you will skip to the mission {M:Aphmau's Light|Aphmau's Light|Aphmau's Light}.

=3 If you have not started the {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Category:Aht Urhgan Missions}
* You will progress to the mission {M:The Endless Sky|The Endless Sky|The Endless Sky}, the placeholder mission to continue.
** In order to receive the Trust Cipher, you must be past the third {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Mission|Category:Aht Urhgan Missions}: {M:President Salaheem|Aht Urhgan Mission 3|President Salaheem}

=3 Regarding the Cipher Reward
You only need to speak to Abquhbah after receiving the cutscene in your home nation to obtain it.
